        <name>StopPlayback</name>
        <qualifiedname>UTryllSpeakerComponent::StopPlayback</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Cancels the current playback: drops all queued audio and ignores further audio until the next turn announces its audio format. Fires OnTtsAudioFinished if speech was playing. Does not cancel the agent&apos;s turn — call Cancel on the agent for that. Safe to call repeatedly and when nothing is playing. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
