<para>Called by <ref refid="class_u_tryll_agent_component" kindref="compound">UTryllAgentComponent</ref> when the server announces the audio format for the current turn. (Re)creates the procedural sound if the sample rate differs from the previous turn&apos;s. NodeName (the producing node&apos;s name — multi-sender attribution) is accepted for signature compatibility with FTryllAgent::OnTtsAudioFormat but otherwise unused: this component mixes all producers into one procedural sound. </para>
